==Battleground==
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Cyclone]] spawns.

